# Cloudflare Pages routing for kavogrid.org
#
#   kavogrid.org         -> storefront (index.html, served automatically)
#   kavogrid.org/admin   -> admin console (admin.html)
#
# 200 = rewrite: serve that file while keeping the clean URL in the address bar.
# admin.html loads its scripts with RELATIVE paths (lib/..., admin/...), so it
# must be served at "/admin" with NO trailing slash — the trailing-slash form
# and the legacy paths are 301'd to normalise.

https://www.kavogrid.org/*   https://kavogrid.org/:splat   301

/admin/            /admin        301
/admindashboard    /admin        301
/admindashboard/   /admin        301
/admin             /admin.html   200

/home.html         /             301
/home              /             301
/index.html        /             301
